n\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =\\frac{4{(\\frac{1}{t})}^{2}}{{t}^{3}}=\\frac{4}{{t}^{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}3{x}^{5}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt[4]{2}}f(r(t))\\,‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt[4]{2}}\\frac{4}{{t}^{5}}\\cdot \\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{4}}}\\cdot \\text{d}t \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt[4]{2}}\\frac{1}{{t}^{5}}\\,\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{4}}}\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this using the substitution $u=1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{4}}$, $\\text{d}u=-\\frac{4}{{t}^{5}}\\,\\text{d}t$ as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt[4]{2}}\\frac{1}{{t}^{5}}\\,\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{4}}}\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{2}^{3/2}{u}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{u}^{3/2}{|}_{2}^{3/2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}(\\sqrt{{(\\frac{3}{2})}^{3}}-\\sqrt{{2}^{3}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}(\\frac{3\\sqrt{6}}{4}-2\\sqrt{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}(8\\sqrt{2}-3\\sqrt{6})\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535538 true] [17592186354308 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354309 13194139535538 true] [17592186354308 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354310 13194139535538 true] [17592186354308 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354311 13194139535538 true] [17592186354308 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354312 13194139535538 true] [17592186354308 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354313 13194139535538 true] [17592186354308 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535538 true] [17592186354308 1041 "selection" 13194139535538 true] [17592186354308 1104 #edb/ref 17592186354310 13194139535538 true] [17592186354308 1110 #uuid "23e4960a-1ff4-5265-aae3-3b56a8f5ebba" 13194139535538 true] [17592186354309 1034 "2(16\\sqrt{2}-6\\sqrt{6})" 13194139535538 true] [17592186354309 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535538 true] [17592186354309 1111 #uuid "314a4aef-6933-57af-b2ce-a3d97f5c79ef" 13194139535538 true] [17592186354310 1034 "\\frac{1}{6}(8\\sqrt{2}-3\\sqrt{6})" 13194139535538 true] [17592186354310 1103 #edb/ref 17592186